## Repository Structure

- Tests live under `src/` and use the `*.test.ts` suffix.
- Test discovery is configured in [vitest.config.ts](mdc:vitest.config.ts) to include `src/**/*.test.ts`.
- Project metadata and scripts are defined in [package.json](mdc:package.json).
- TypeScript configuration is in [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json).

## Conventions

- Keep unit tests colocated in `src/` mirroring the feature/topic under test.
- Prefer small, focused test files per topic (e.g., `2-coerce.test.ts`, `3-literal.test.ts`, `4-string.test.ts`).
- Use clear, descriptive test names that mirror the API being verified.

